{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"它沿用 H2、H6、H9 与 M16，把悬而未决的期待、加深的在乎和时间流逝连接到更难收住的欢喜，没有新增前史或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"它将 M27 的心意显露、H2 与 H7 的不确定和独自承受，以及 M28 的身体逐渐放松连成一条局部因果链，并明确说明安静下来不等于获得了答案。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“身体已经先把对方握得更紧”“想用力抱住这个人”将既有历史、原解释和候选均未确立的具体肢体动作写成了已经发生的事实，超出了补充局部心理过程的范围，尽管其背后的不舍与不确定性有 H6、H2、H7 和 M25 支撑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"它以 H6 的时间流逝意识和 H8 已经出现的不安解释快乐尚未结束时便产生的心酸，并以 M43 衔接热烈与不舍，没有新增事件或改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都明确交代了当下的情绪及其与关系不确定性、在乎程度和时间流逝之间的联系，不依赖听感记录也能读懂整体心理脉络。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "39392798-1769-4d6e-b594-4448e28c4276", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T143853986572Z", "elapsed_seconds": 232.454, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:42:46.452555+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "068ac34b512765f8c59d4f2634bc14abe4f326b20695899f5fa94ce82694810d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "i